    <div>
      <p begin="00:00.430" end="00:01.930" ttm:agent="v1">Not sure who I am</p>
      <p begin="00:01.880" end="00:04.350" ttm:agent="v1">Not sure who I wanna be</p>
      <p begin="00:04.350" end="00:05.930" ttm:agent="v1">All this shit's a scam</p>
      <p begin="00:05.930" end="00:08.370" ttm:agent="v1">I don't wanna be me</p>
      <p begin="00:08.370" end="00:09.870" ttm:agent="v1">This ain't what I want</p>
      <p begin="00:09.870" end="00:12.350" ttm:agent="v1">This is everything I need</p>
      <p begin="00:12.350" end="00:13.860" ttm:agent="v1">Know I don't belong</p>
      <p begin="00:13.860" end="00:15.960" ttm:agent="v1">Can't contain my jealousy</p>
      <p begin="00:15.960" end="00:17.750" ttm:agent="v1">Stop! Looking at yourself</p>
      <p begin="00:17.750" end="00:19.870" ttm:agent="v1">You're caught up in my spell</p>
      <p begin="00:19.870" end="00:21.720" ttm:agent="v1">No hope, cant you tell?</p>
      <p begin="00:21.720" end="00:23.890" ttm:agent="v1">This ain't no wishing well</p>
      <p begin="00:23.890" end="00:26.230" ttm:agent="v1">Stop! I can't agree</p>
      <p begin="00:26.230" end="00:28.250" ttm:agent="v1">With you I cant believe</p>
      <p begin="00:28.250" end="00:30.040" ttm:agent="v1">This feeling's jealousy</p>
      <p begin="00:30.040" end="00:35.180" ttm:agent="v1">Tell me, who was I born to be?</p>
      <p begin="00:35.180" end="00:39.030" ttm:agent="v1">What's wrong with me?</p>
